{
  "Name": "Windows Run Command As User",
  "Description": "This module will login with the specified username/password and execute the supplied command as a hidden process. Output is not returned by default. Unless targeting a local user either set the DOMAIN, or specify a UPN user format (e.g. user@domain). This uses the CreateProcessWithLogonW WinAPI function. A custom command line can be sent instead of uploading an executable. APPLICAITON_NAME and COMMAND_LINE are passed to lpApplicationName and lpCommandLine respectively. See the MSDN documentation for how these two values interact.",
